{"id":"la_stima","lemma":"lástima","pos":"noun","rank":1190,"glosses":["pity"],"ipa":"/ˈlastima/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"lástimas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-l%C3%A1stima.wav","examples":[{"text":"Qué lástima.","en":"What a pity!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/39180","words":[{"g":"what"},null]},{"text":"Eso es una verdadera lástima.","en":"That's a real shame.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/522459","words":[null,null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"true, real","l":"verdadero"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"that's it"]]},{"text":"Ella tuvo lástima por él.","en":"She took pity on him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453767","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"he"}]},{"text":"Nunca confundas lástima con amor.","en":"Never confuse pity with love.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/333676","words":[{"g":"never"},{"g":"to confuse","l":"confundir"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"love"}]},{"text":"Es una lástima que no lo sepas.","en":"It's a pity that you don't know that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689000","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"}]}]}